# Ybex — v376 (Ravi: "sab ek hi YBEX_ENV mein copy-paste ho jaaye, alag-alag na daalna pade").
# AI Studio asks for the secrets listed in THIS file. It now lists only YBEX_ENV: ONE secret holding every setting,
# one KEY=value per line (Supabase, Razorpay, Google sign-in, Cloudflare proxy, VAPID, Resend, Instagram, …).
# The full list with notes: docs/setup/SETUP_GUIDES.md (YBEX_ENV template part) — fill it in and paste it as the value of YBEX_ENV.
# The server unpacks it first thing (backend/envBundle.ts); the website build reads its VITE_* lines (vite.config.js).
# GEMINI_API_KEY is provided by AI Studio itself.
# For a local run on the Mac, use local.env (scripts/mac-local.sh) instead.
YBEX_ENV=""
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
